<title>USA: American Rice Inc Q2 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>American Rice Inc Q2 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.21     loss	 $0.65</p>
<p> Net loss		     507     loss	 1,584</p>
<p> Revs		     121,513		   90,369</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     N/A			N/A</p>
<p>	  6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.88     loss	 $1.10</p>
<p> Net loss		   4,585     loss	 2,690</p>
<p> Revs		     218,920		  176,761</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     N/A			N/A</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it posted a 96 Q2 net income of $976,000 compared to a net loss of $101,000 last year, before the $1.5 million preferred stock dividend requirement. The dividend requirement recorded for the six-month periods of 1996 and 1995 was $2.97 million.</p>
